        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium, enriched 4.0% for boiling water reactor</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium, enriched 4.0% for boiling water reactor
The shares are estimated based on known enrichment services in mid 1990s and rough analysis of the current average supply in Europe. The entire production of the URENCO plant in Gronau is assumed to be delivered to German nuclear power plants. ;
UUID: 4493897a-6310-31a8-b72e-6edf815dfba4
The module includes the shares of enrichment services from different suppliers.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Not applicable.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4493897a-6310-31a8-b72e-6edf815dfba4.xml</text>
